      "writtenOn": "2016-11-28T19:46:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "P. S. To clarify, confusingly, these are codenames which are sometimes encountered in android:minSdkVersion on non-release builds of Android platform. These are not the same as the codenames in android.os.Build.VERSION_CODES. For example, an APK with minSdkVersion\u003d\"N\" will not run on release builds of Android Nougat devices. Generally, release builds of Android reject APKs with minSdkVersion set to a codename.",
      "parentUuid": "d041ec2c_dfc24b24",
